# Sweet Bites Bakery Website

Welcome to the Sweet Bites Bakery website project! This website showcases a variety of delicious pastries and treats available at Sweet Bites. Visitors can explore the menu, learn about the bakery, and get in touch with us through our contact page.

## Features

- **Home Page**: Welcome message and call-to-action to explore the menu.
- **Menu Page**: Displays the selection of freshly baked pastries.
- **About Page**: Information about the bakery, our story, and our commitment to quality.
- **Contact Page**: Includes contact information and links to WhatsApp and Instagram.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## How to Use

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the HTML files (`index.html`, `menu.html`, `about.html`, `contact.html`) in your preferred web browser to view the website.

